rom other planes, dealing an additional 6d10 bane damage vs. Evil Outsiders.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Vorpal#Superior_Vorpal\" title=\"Vorpal\"> Superior Vorpal</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vorpal#Superior_Vorpal\" title=\"Vorpal\"> Superior Vorpal</a>:</b> Passive: <a href=\"/page/Weapon_dice_multiplier\" title=\"Weapon dice multiplier\">+0.5[W]</a> damage dice.<br />On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Hit</a>: If your target has fewer than 2500 Hit Points, they are instantly slain. If your target has above 2500 Hit Points, they take 250 damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Crushing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Crushing\">Crushing 13</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Crushing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Crushing\">Crushing 13</a>:</b> This effect causes the edges of this weapon to ripple with force, dealing 13d6 force damage on each critical hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Spectral_Warhammer_(level_28).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img sr